                    <figcaption><strong>Rich TUI.</strong><span>See the matches in your terminal, pick one, and get back to work.</span></figcaption>
                </figure>
                <figure class="cta-card scroll-stack-card">
                  <div class="cta-shot has-image">
                    <img class="cta-shot-image" src={`${base}COmmands%20showcase.png`} alt="WTFIS command shortcuts for finding directories" decoding="async" width="1541" height="1201" />
                  </div>
                  <figcaption><strong>Built-in commands.</strong><span>Use <code>cdd</code> to find the folder, then add a command for WTFIS to run after <code>cd</code>.</span></figcaption>
                </figure>
                <figure class="cta-card scroll-stack-card">
                  <div class="cta-shot has-image">
